accTitle: Isolate one account from discount sharing
accDescr: The management account disables discount sharing for the business-unit account while other accounts remain in the shared billing discount pool.
M[Management account Billing preferences]:::process -->|Sharing off| B[Business-unit account]:::storage
M -->|Sharing remains on| P[Other enabled member accounts]:::process
R[Business-unit RI commitment]:::inputData -->|Eligible owner usage only| B
P <--> D[Shared discount pool for other accounts]:::storage
N[Organization membership is unchanged]:::reference -.-> B
